{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51104","headline":"行次山阳续家太尉寄赐衣段令充归觐续寿信物谨以诗谢 · 崔致远","name":"行次山阳续家太尉寄赐衣段令充归觐续寿信物谨以诗谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自古虽夸昼锦行，长卿翁子占虚名。\n既传国信兼家信，不独家荣国亦荣。\n万里始成归去计，一心先算却来程。\n望中遥想深恩处，三朵仙山目畔横。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}